{"4351620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Italia 1915–1918 : Great War Logistics", "steam_appid": 4351620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command an Italian camp on the front lines of the Great War. Every turn counts, every building has a purpose, every soldier a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Italia 1915–1918 : Great War Logistics</i> is a turn-based management game set in the encampments of the Italian Army during World War I. Step into the boots of the commander: organize the camp's structures, manage men and resources, and keep your unit alive from dawn to the freezing night, turn after turn, as the front looms ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every order begins at the Command Office. From the Mess Hall to the Barracks, from the Field Hospital to the Supply Depot, every building you upgrade makes your camp more efficient and your soldiers more ready. And when evening falls, camp life goes on: the tavern comes alive, sentries stand their watch, couriers dash from building to building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Between the mud of the trenches and the warmth of a mess tin, war isn't won only at the front. It's won in the camp too. Are you ready to command?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command an Italian camp on the front lines of the Great War. Every turn counts, every building has a purpose, every soldier a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Italia 1915–1918 : Great War Logistics</i> is a turn-based management game set in the encampments of the Italian Army during World War I. Step into the boots of the commander: organize the camp's structures, manage men and resources, and keep your unit alive from dawn to the freezing night, turn after turn, as the front looms ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every order begins at the Command Office. From the Mess Hall to the Barracks, from the Field Hospital to the Supply Depot, every building you upgrade makes your camp more efficient and your soldiers more ready. And when evening falls, camp life goes on: the tavern comes alive, sentries stand their watch, couriers dash from building to building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Between the mud of the trenches and the warmth of a mess tin, war isn't won only at the front. It's won in the camp too. Are you ready to command?</i></p>", "short_description": "A turn-based management game set in WWI: command an Italian Army camp, upgrade its buildings, manage men and resources, and keep your unit alive through day and night, turn after turn, as the front line draws ever closer.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351620/5f61c786db4a2b4f6df545db957934451557b4ce/header.jpg?t=1784821543", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351620/4733d1d7f27dfdf986745ac2a69b312a12a16c5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784821543", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351620/4733d1d7f27dfdf986745ac2a69b312a12a16c5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784821543", "website": "https://carrotgamestudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4170 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD R7 260X (2 GB VRAM, Requires a Vulkan-capable GPU)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan 1.0</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 